        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Pierre Garnier has a voice that is as unique as it is powerful, and an endearing personality that has won him the hearts of millions of fans. Having become a key figure on the French music scene with his debut album \"Chaque Seconde,\" Pierre Garnier has performed all over France this year during a triumphant tour of concerts and festivals. Recorded in early December 2025 at the Accor Arena in Paris's 12th arrondissement.",
